      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ESCAPE REALITY (2) got around the 520m at this track to take a Maiden in a good 29.97 for a 3.5 lengths success. Rates a top chance again if runs up to latest. WILD RAMPAGE (8) was in the money last start when second in a Novice race in 30.06, clocking one of the quickest times on the card and a personal best this course and distance as well. Strong run and expected to feature again. GRACEFUL DASH (3) was a course and distance placegetter (30.41) last time also from the same draw, finishing a 7 length third in a Novice race. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. ASTON BEYOND (4) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
